*---------------------- HEADER FIELD
* Hand-written synthetic chart (CC0 / public domain) built from the BMS fiche of vsrg-format-docs.
* #LNTYPE 2 (MGQ type): a long note is a run of non-00 objects on a long-note channel (51 = 1P key 1,
* 52 = 1P key 2, 56 = 1P scratch); it ends at the first 00 slot and may continue across a bar line.

#PLAYER 1
#GENRE Test
#TITLE Synthetic LNTYPE 2
#ARTIST vsrg-format-docs
#BPM 140
#PLAYLEVEL 3
#RANK 2
#LNTYPE 2

#WAV01 bgm.ogg
#WAV02 tap.wav

*---------------------- MAIN DATA FIELD

#00001:01
* measure 0: a run of three slots on key 1 (slots 1, 2, 3 of 8), a normal tap on key 2
#00051:0002020200000000
#00011:0000000000000200

* measures 1-2: a run that starts on the last slot of measure 1 and goes through the first two slots of measure 2 (crosses the bar line)
#00152:0000000000000002
#00252:0202000000000000

* measure 3: a short run on the scratch lane (channel 56)
#00356:02020000
